From: Zhao_Wang <umi@xiaomi>
Subject: [PATCH] qrtr/wwan: QRTR over MHI + wwan data path for the SDX55m

Xiaomi Mi 10 (umi): qrtr/wwan: QRTR over MHI + wwan data path for the SDX55m — ported from the Mi 10T pmOS
kernel set onto 7.2.11; naming unified to umi. Part of the
SDX55m external modem (mobile data) bring-up.

Signed-off-by: Zhao_Wang <umi@xiaomi>
---
